This folder is the use case of the BS2023 paper "Sensitivity Analysis of building archetypes for the life cycle assessments of districts"
by Schildt, Maximilian; Ponec, Anna; Tayeb, Yacine; Cuypers, Johannes Linus; Frisch, Jérôme; van Treeck, Christoph Alban; 2023
(https://doi.org/10.26868/25222708.2023.1154). Functionality can no longer be guaranteed given multiple updates
of both Teco and TEASER+.